Subject: [PATCH] getminidump: Add a small tool to create minidumps.

Signed-off-by: Nikolay Sivov <nsivov@codeweavers.com>
(cherry picked from commit 472ebd9fa99f6d763711d33ccb2ac7fde9d7292b)
